<h1>Bind Views - Relative</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Windows &gt; Bind Views &gt; Relative</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Open two or more documents and tile them horizontally or vertically.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span></b> <span lang="EN-GB">When enabled</span> <span class="Command">Bind Views - Relative</span> <span lang="EN-GB">will cause all open windows to display the same visible region and to update all views simultaneously according to the active window. This means that all commands (</span><span class="Command">Zoom</span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command">Rotate</span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command">Pan</span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command">change light direction</span><span lang="EN-GB">, etc.) applied to the active window will have the same effect on all other windows in their extents at the time this mode was enabled.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is applicable for different documents. When this mode is enabled the command is marked with a tick and a jagged chain icon appears at the top left corner of every window:</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="Images/bindview_relative_icon.gif" width="376px" height="496px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Call</span> <span class="Command">Bind Views - None</span> <span lang="EN-GB">to disable it. The state of</span> <span class="Command">Bind Views - Relative</span> <span lang="EN-GB">is not stored so next time when you run KUBE will be disabled.</span></p>
<p class="Use"><span class="Command">Bind Views - Relative</span> <span lang="EN-GB">is</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>useful</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">when you want to compare two or more objects (in different documents) that are further apart from each other and not equally oriented.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="javascript:void(0);" onclick="var e; if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion)&gt;=4){e=event;} if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) &gt;=2 &amp;&amp; typeof(PopupMenu_Invoke) == 'function') PopupMenu_Invoke(e,'','Bind Views - Absolute','bind_views.htm','Bind Views - None','bind_views_none.htm','Tile Horizontally','Tile_Horizontally.htm','Tile Vertically','Tile_Vertically.htm');return false;" title=""><img src="../add_on/ss_btn_see_also.gif" border="0" height="17" width="60" alt=""></a></span></p>
